WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.196
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:24.466 --> 00:27.466
Vineyard tomorrow. Be outside your dorm at 6 AM sharp.

3
00:27.933 --> 00:30.300
Is your name Yut or Simp?

4
00:30.700 --> 00:34.400
Next time, don't smile at that old man again, Boss.

5
00:34.933 --> 00:35.733
I'm jealous.

6
00:37.733 --> 00:39.533
I thought you said you didn't like me.

7
00:41.866 --> 00:44.017
Or are you just too turned on to remember?"

8
00:45.048 --> 00:46.214
You're quite the smooth talker.

9
00:46.625 --> 00:48.491
So where do you want me to kiss you?

10
00:48.956 --> 00:49.756
Your upper lip...

11
00:51.350 --> 00:52.150
or...

12
00:53.680 --> 00:55.052
your lower lip?

13
01:08.190 --> 01:08.990
Wake up.

14
01:18.471 --> 01:19.600
I know you're awake.

15
01:19.600 --> 01:20.369
Get up.

16
01:24.037 --> 01:25.537
Why are you up so early?

17
01:26.229 --> 01:27.197
It's already ten.

18
01:27.639 --> 01:28.844
That's not early anymore.

19
01:29.307 --> 01:31.734
Get up and take a shower.

20
01:34.778 --> 01:36.078
What's wrong with you, Boss?

21
01:37.875 --> 01:39.175
Why are you so grumpy?

22
01:40.937 --> 01:41.804
I'm not grumpy.

23
01:42.232 --> 01:43.198
You're the one...

24
01:43.532 --> 01:45.632
You left me hanging like that last night...

25
01:47.837 --> 01:48.637
What do you mean?

26
01:51.137 --> 01:52.548
Hanging?

27
01:54.089 --> 01:55.460
What kind of hanging?

28
01:58.286 --> 01:59.819
That's not what I meant.

29
02:02.965 --> 02:06.898
Okay, I'll wait until another time.

30
02:10.309 --> 02:14.675
Or do you want your naughty task first thing in the morning?

31
02:21.671 --> 02:24.837
Get up and shower. We still have work to do.

32
02:25.625 --> 02:27.858
Think carefully before you answer.

33
02:28.863 --> 02:29.863
Thitinant!

34
02:31.017 --> 02:31.517
Get up.

35
02:31.517 --> 02:33.483
I'll give you one more chance.

36
02:35.750 --> 02:36.550
Go take a shower!

37
02:51.271 --> 02:52.171
Thitinant!

38
02:56.644 --> 02:57.511
I'm going.

39
04:18.616 --> 04:21.424
These grapes have been specially selected.

40
04:22.623 --> 04:24.071
They're very sweet.

41
04:24.813 --> 04:28.073
Well, I doubt they're as sweet as you, Ms. Chat.

42
04:30.049 --> 04:32.019
Let's talk about the figures instead.

43
04:32.704 --> 04:36.187
We can discuss the taste during the production trial.

44
04:43.616 --> 04:45.002
I've already taken detailed notes

45
04:45.002 --> 04:46.649
on all the grape varieties.

46
04:54.982 --> 04:55.782
Oh!

47
04:56.482 --> 04:57.616
An insect, Ms. Chat.

48
04:58.049 --> 04:59.382
Let me shoo it away.

49
05:01.516 --> 05:02.316
Young lady.

50
05:02.316 --> 05:03.049
Yes?

51
05:03.049 --> 05:04.716
If you have nothing work-related to do,

52
05:05.282 --> 05:06.816
you can wait outside.

53
05:07.316 --> 05:08.116
Of course I do.

54
05:09.816 --> 05:12.003
A secretary has to stay by her boss's side at all times.

55
05:12.517 --> 05:14.533
We can't afford to miss anything.

56
05:16.132 --> 05:17.516
Especially when it comes to insects.

57
05:18.049 --> 05:22.382
Your secretary really doesn't make any sense.

58
05:27.316 --> 05:27.863
Does she?

59
05:28.948 --> 05:32.816
I think my secretary is doing her job perfectly well.

60
05:36.682 --> 05:38.416
And I'm very pleased with her.

61
05:40.782 --> 05:42.682
Let's get back to business.

62
05:43.649 --> 05:44.982
As for the contract we discussed,

63
05:45.582 --> 05:47.182
I agree to the original terms.

64
05:50.249 --> 05:51.049
That's great, then.

65
05:52.249 --> 05:54.216
In that case, how about we...

66
05:56.616 --> 05:58.412
As for the details from here on,

67
05:58.812 --> 06:01.016
I'll have Mr. Karn take over.

68
06:01.382 --> 06:02.082
What?

69
06:02.082 --> 06:04.516
I think two men would find it easier to work together.

70
06:05.582 --> 06:06.696
As for me,

71
06:07.039 --> 06:09.174
I probably won't be coming here to oversee things in person anymore.

72
06:09.174 --> 06:11.682
But I hope this project goes smoothly.

73
06:12.616 --> 06:13.606
And...

74
06:14.291 --> 06:14.791
Nant.

75
06:15.248 --> 06:17.739
Pack your things. We're leaving.

76
06:18.649 --> 06:21.382
Ms. Chat, but I... Wait... I mean...

77
06:21.716 --> 06:24.416
Take care of your health, Unc.

78
06:25.616 --> 06:27.982
Especially when it comes to insects.

79
06:28.816 --> 06:30.882
Goodbye, Unc. Bye!

80
06:31.816 --> 06:34.649
But... Ms. Chat...Wait...

81
06:55.449 --> 06:56.582
It's only raining a little.

82
06:56.982 --> 06:58.582
My room is fine to sleep in,

83
06:59.416 --> 07:01.416
you didn't have to drag me over here.

84
07:05.816 --> 07:09.313
Far,and The roads might flood, and traffic will be bad.

85
07:09.598 --> 07:11.419
I'm not driving you home tonight.

86
07:12.732 --> 07:16.396
So you're staying here.

87
07:21.216 --> 07:22.182
Don't be so suspicious.

88
07:23.116 --> 07:24.582
I'm not going to do anything to you.

89
07:33.316 --> 07:34.216
You won't do anything.

90
07:37.516 --> 07:39.582
But I'm not so sure about myself.

91
07:41.249 --> 07:42.382
I might do something.

92
07:53.782 --> 07:54.882
Then you sleep over there.

93
07:55.567 --> 07:56.578
I'll take the bed.

94
07:57.316 --> 07:59.777
And don't you dare come over here.

95
08:00.462 --> 08:01.463
Got it?

96
08:05.249 --> 08:06.049
Okay.

97
08:11.716 --> 08:12.816
Go take a shower.

98
08:13.716 --> 08:14.849
We've had a long day.

99
08:48.098 --> 08:49.065
Get a grip on yourself.

100
08:49.165 --> 08:49.965
Theerachat.

101
08:50.698 --> 08:51.498
Damn it.

102
08:54.565 --> 08:55.465
Stop thinking about it.

103
08:55.531 --> 08:56.331
Theerachat.

104
09:12.131 --> 09:14.231
What are you waiting for, Theerachat?

105
09:14.916 --> 09:18.839
Or are you hoping that girl strips naked to seduce you again today?

106
09:20.323 --> 09:22.035
But what if...

107
09:26.365 --> 09:28.065
she actually comes over like that again?

108
09:30.265 --> 09:31.065
Whoa!

109
09:31.431 --> 09:32.231
Whoa!

110
09:34.098 --> 09:35.765
Get a grip, Theerachat!

111
09:36.231 --> 09:38.531
Control yourself! Damn it!

112
09:41.431 --> 09:42.412
Don't think about it.

113
09:43.765 --> 09:44.621
Don't pay attention.

114
09:45.991 --> 09:48.371
Just keep repeating, "Sleep."

115
09:49.570 --> 09:52.003
Right, I have to ignore her.

116
09:52.631 --> 09:56.137
Sleep, sleep... Go to sleep.

117
09:59.731 --> 10:00.531
Sleep.

118
10:39.065 --> 10:40.165
Have you been waiting long?

119
10:41.298 --> 10:42.118
Who's waiting for you?

120
10:42.974 --> 10:44.421
I've been asleep for ages.

121
11:13.331 --> 11:14.965
Why are you tsking at me, Boss?

122
11:16.831 --> 11:17.698
Disappointed?

123
11:20.698 --> 11:21.498
No.

124
11:22.498 --> 11:24.331
It's just the rain. It's annoying me.

125
11:28.965 --> 11:29.765
Oh, really?

126
11:30.831 --> 11:31.631
Yeah.

127
11:33.765 --> 11:35.698
I thought you were disappointed.

128
11:40.031 --> 11:42.265
Like you were waiting for me to wear yesterday's lingerie.

129
11:45.065 --> 11:46.031
Sorry to disappoint you.

130
11:48.231 --> 11:49.665
It's just too cold in here tonight.

131
12:22.331 --> 12:23.831
Want to continue that kiss?

132
12:32.698 --> 12:35.698
No answer means you don't want to.

133
13:11.665 --> 13:13.698
How am I supposed to sleep tonight?

134
13:15.031 --> 13:15.965
You little brat.

135
13:27.331 --> 13:28.431
So soft.

136
14:02.065 --> 14:02.865
Hey!

137
14:06.298 --> 14:08.765
Were you touching me while I was asleep, Boss?

138
14:11.431 --> 14:12.665
You're quite naughty, aren't you?

139
14:15.265 --> 14:17.308
Are you crazy? Who touched you?

140
14:17.308 --> 14:20.531
I'm the one who should be asking you why you're in my bed.

141
14:24.731 --> 14:26.431
The sofa was uncomfortable.

142
14:27.365 --> 14:28.865
And there's plenty of room on this bed.

143
14:29.165 --> 14:30.731
So I just moved over.

144
14:31.965 --> 14:33.065
I just didn't expect

145
14:34.931 --> 14:37.565
to wake up with my buttons undone.

146
14:43.031 --> 14:43.965
I didn't undo them.

147
14:44.631 --> 14:46.065
Your pajamas is old.

148
14:46.298 --> 14:47.498
The buttons must've come undone by themselves.

149
14:48.431 --> 14:49.831
Don't accuse me!

150
15:12.265 --> 15:13.065
Sigh...

151
15:14.265 --> 15:16.831
I thought you wanted some milk first thing in the morning.

152
15:20.065 --> 15:20.865
You perverted.

153
15:21.031 --> 15:23.365
Button your shirt right now.

154
15:23.731 --> 15:25.431
Then get off my bed.

155
15:27.031 --> 15:27.831
Get off!

156
15:29.031 --> 15:30.065
I don't know how to.

157
15:54.135 --> 15:56.135
Boss, between the milk in your hand

158
15:58.834 --> 16:00.834
and mine...

159
16:01.665 --> 16:03.165
which one looks more appetizing?

160
16:10.098 --> 16:11.931
Who would want to drink spoiled milk?

161
16:24.665 --> 16:25.698
Spoiled milk?

162
16:27.298 --> 16:28.098
Yeah.

163
16:30.431 --> 16:32.065
You really don't find it appetizing?

164
16:33.531 --> 16:34.331
No.

165
16:35.765 --> 16:38.898
No...not appetizing at all.

166
17:54.298 --> 17:55.744
This milk isn't spoiled.

167
17:57.000 --> 17:58.783
It's even sweet.

168
18:31.865 --> 18:34.705
Nant, get down first.

169
18:38.472 --> 18:39.431
Someone's calling.

170
18:47.098 --> 18:48.065
It's Chom!

171
18:57.265 --> 18:58.331
Hello, Chat.

172
18:58.665 --> 18:59.465
Are you awake yet?

173
19:00.165 --> 19:01.065
Hello, Chom.

174
19:01.465 --> 19:03.031
Why are you calling so early?

175
19:04.865 --> 19:06.898
How did it end up looking like this?

176
19:08.031 --> 19:10.498
Hey! Why is your bed such a mess?

177
19:11.031 --> 19:12.898
You're usually such a neat freak.

178
19:16.831 --> 19:18.631
I was hungry, so I had some milk.

179
19:20.531 --> 19:23.531
Serious? Someone as strict as you is eating on the bed?

180
19:24.165 --> 19:26.031
What's so strange about that?

181
19:26.731 --> 19:29.465
It's super weird. Something's suspicious.

182
19:30.331 --> 19:32.631
Are you hiding someone in your room?

183
19:33.031 --> 19:33.831
Come on, tell me the truth.

184
19:34.231 --> 19:35.031
No.

185
19:35.331 --> 19:36.331
Are you crazy?

186
19:41.365 --> 19:43.165
Then whose stuff is that?

187
19:43.631 --> 19:44.431
Huh?

188
19:44.431 --> 19:45.231
What?

189
19:48.098 --> 19:48.898
The housekeeper's.

190
19:49.265 --> 19:50.265
You don't have a housekeeper.

191
19:51.065 --> 19:54.298
I just hired one yesterday.

192
19:56.931 --> 20:00.665
Do you think I wouldn't recognize Nant's backpack?

193
20:01.098 --> 20:01.898
Ow!

194
20:03.565 --> 20:04.365
Ow.

195
20:05.131 --> 20:05.931
That hurts.

196
20:06.165 --> 20:06.965
Uh...

197
20:07.731 --> 20:08.831
The bed caught my leg.

198
20:09.231 --> 20:11.331
Nant, come out. I know you're there.

199
20:16.931 --> 20:17.898
Hello.

200
20:21.231 --> 20:24.565
Is this the milk you were having in bed?

201
20:25.965 --> 20:26.765
Chom!

202
20:27.331 --> 20:28.383
Are you crazy?

203
20:28.383 --> 20:28.883
Hmm?

204
20:29.665 --> 20:30.498
It's not like that.

205
20:31.065 --> 20:32.031
It's really not like that.

206
20:32.431 --> 20:33.865
If it's not like that, then what is it?

207
20:34.365 --> 20:35.740
You're so cheeky.

208
20:35.740 --> 20:36.240
Chom!

209
20:36.365 --> 20:37.165
You little brat.

210
20:38.098 --> 20:38.898
You!

211
20:39.165 --> 20:40.165
Go take a shower right now.

212
20:40.465 --> 20:41.631
And get dressed properly.

213
20:43.098 --> 20:43.898
Go!

214
20:44.365 --> 20:45.165
Hurry up!

215
20:48.565 --> 20:49.365
Go get dressed!

216
20:58.931 --> 21:00.365
What is your excuse now?

217
21:01.031 --> 21:01.531
Huh?

218
21:01.531 --> 21:03.298
There's really nothing going on. Ow!

219
21:03.531 --> 21:05.098
I'm hanging up now. I need to rest.

220
21:05.531 --> 21:06.731
Nothing going on, really?

221
21:07.165 --> 21:07.965
Ow!

222
21:08.131 --> 21:08.931
Well...

223
21:09.565 --> 21:12.524
It was late last night.

224
21:12.524 --> 21:15.093
And traffic was terrible. There was no way home.

225
21:15.436 --> 21:18.041
So I just let her stay here. That's all.

226
21:18.265 --> 21:19.151
That's all?

227
21:19.436 --> 21:22.550
You have so many rooms. Why did you have to sleep together?

228
21:25.165 --> 21:28.284
I mean... We got back and were already tired.

229
21:28.684 --> 21:31.425
I didn't think it through, so I let her sleep on the sofa.

230
21:31.425 --> 21:34.065
There's really nothing going on. Why are you so suspicious?

231
21:34.631 --> 21:37.135
Hmm. Nothing going on, really?

232
21:37.135 --> 21:40.365
You never let anyone into your condo.

233
21:41.065 --> 21:43.231
I told you there's nothing going on. Then there's nothing going on, Chom.

234
21:43.665 --> 21:44.465
Ow!

235
21:44.465 --> 21:47.231
What's with all the questions? I'm going to get some rest.

236
21:47.765 --> 21:48.565
Okay.

237
21:52.231 --> 21:54.586
Hello, Mom. I've got big news!

238
21:54.586 --> 21:57.359
Remember how you told me to keep an eye on Chat?

239
21:57.359 --> 21:58.698
I found something.

240
21:59.298 --> 22:00.098
What did you find?

241
22:00.498 --> 22:02.365
I found Nant in Chat's room.

242
22:02.720 --> 22:04.720
Wait... Nant? That secretary intern?

243
22:06.131 --> 22:09.684
Yes. Chat said they got back late last night,

244
22:09.684 --> 22:11.621
so she let Nant stay over.

245
22:11.621 --> 22:13.498
But I think something's fishy.

246
22:14.431 --> 22:16.865
Could these two have known each other before the wedding?

247
22:17.565 --> 22:18.965
What do you mean, Mom?

248
22:20.078 --> 22:25.606
I'm just guessing. Chat might be planning something.

249
22:25.606 --> 22:28.015
Or that girl might be approaching her for some reason.

250
22:28.765 --> 22:30.898
So what should I do next?

251
22:32.659 --> 22:34.659
Just keep doing what you're doing. Watch them both.

252
22:34.659 --> 22:39.228
I'll have someone investigate Nant's background.

253
22:39.228 --> 22:41.083
I want to know if this girl

254
22:41.197 --> 22:43.569
had any connection to Chat before joining the company.

255
22:43.898 --> 22:47.431
Of course. I'll keep an eye on their every move, Mom.

256
22:51.298 --> 22:54.231
And please send the details to me by email, okay?

257
22:54.631 --> 22:55.431
Yes.

258
22:58.931 --> 23:01.294
Secretary Han, can I ask you something?

259
23:01.294 --> 23:02.098
Of course.

260
23:03.265 --> 23:06.831
Do you know why Chat came back from the vineyard earlier than planned?

261
23:07.965 --> 23:11.731
Something must have happened that upset her.

262
23:13.431 --> 23:15.498
Was Mr. Yut hitting on her too much?

263
23:17.131 --> 23:18.165
Something like that.

264
23:19.098 --> 23:22.588
By the way, what do you think?

265
23:22.588 --> 23:24.149
Do you think Chat and Nant

266
23:24.149 --> 23:26.631
are more than just boss and subordinate?

267
23:28.431 --> 23:29.231
I don't think so.

268
23:31.131 --> 23:33.331
They're just getting closer, that's all.

269
23:33.565 --> 23:35.465
Ever since they went to karaoke.

270
23:36.265 --> 23:37.065
How much closer?

271
23:37.665 --> 23:40.498
They switched to nicknames.

272
23:41.098 --> 23:41.898
That's it?

273
23:45.265 --> 23:48.606
Oh, here she comes.

274
23:48.606 --> 23:50.831
Why don't you ask her yourself, Chom?

275
23:51.331 --> 23:56.217
Hey, Nant fancy meeting you again. We barely talked this morning.

276
23:57.073 --> 23:59.436
So, did you enjoy the vineyard?

277
24:01.965 --> 24:02.765
Uh...

278
24:04.565 --> 24:05.365
Nant.

279
24:06.665 --> 24:08.298
We were just there for work.

280
24:09.465 --> 24:10.631
How should I answer this?

281
24:11.065 --> 24:11.865
Uh...

282
24:14.165 --> 24:14.965
But...

283
24:18.298 --> 24:19.565
Everything went smoothly.

284
24:22.665 --> 24:23.698
Mr. Yut's wine

285
24:25.831 --> 24:26.698
was so delicious.

286
24:28.565 --> 24:30.765
And how was your trip back?

287
24:31.931 --> 24:32.731
Did you have fun?

288
24:33.665 --> 24:34.465
Huh?

289
24:37.931 --> 24:38.725
Chom.

290
24:40.438 --> 24:44.265
Since when do board members like you conduct staff interviews themselves?

291
24:45.665 --> 24:50.131
I'm just curious. This morning, I didn't even get to...

292
24:51.465 --> 24:52.740
If you want to know something about me,

293
24:53.311 --> 24:56.098
ask me directly. Don't pressure my employees.

294
24:57.231 --> 25:01.631
Look at you, sticking up for her.

295
25:03.131 --> 25:06.098
Of course. She's my employee.

296
25:08.965 --> 25:11.865
Besides, I don't like anyone disrupting work.

297
25:13.462 --> 25:14.263
Yes.

298
25:19.898 --> 25:20.698
As for you, Karn.

299
25:20.765 --> 25:21.265
Yes?

300
25:21.265 --> 25:21.965
Come here.

301
25:24.565 --> 25:25.898
About the banana project,

302
25:26.131 --> 25:29.331
have the team find suitable locations and land for growing bananas.

303
25:29.831 --> 25:30.631
Understood.

304
25:31.698 --> 25:34.065
And have Nant compile everything and send it to me as soon as possible.

305
25:34.698 --> 25:35.214
Yes.

306
25:35.214 --> 25:36.031
Understood?

307
25:36.531 --> 25:37.331
Understood.

308
25:38.365 --> 25:40.831
Nant, do you understand?

309
25:41.831 --> 25:43.465
Understood, Boss Chat.

310
27:11.265 --> 27:12.065
Nant.

311
27:15.965 --> 27:19.531
Nant, I've missed you.

312
27:21.865 --> 27:23.498
I've missed you too, Chat.

313
27:26.565 --> 27:29.565
Nant... I...

314
27:30.765 --> 27:32.265
Do you want to do it?

315
28:04.865 --> 28:06.165
You belong to me, Nant.

316
28:24.498 --> 28:26.782
(Nant's do the ringtone sound.)

317
29:07.831 --> 29:09.907
Oh, right.

318
29:10.535 --> 29:12.317
This is the banana processing project.

319
29:13.402 --> 29:15.779
I've compiled all the figures

320
29:16.750 --> 29:18.139
for the factory in Kamphaeng Phet.

321
29:18.824 --> 29:23.765
Also, Karn got all the details on the banana land ready for you, Boss.

322
29:40.865 --> 29:42.865
What are you doing?

323
29:46.965 --> 29:48.631
I'm giving you a massage, Boss.

324
29:54.931 --> 29:58.631
Or would you rather do something else instead?

325
30:03.865 --> 30:05.698
You're getting way too good at teasing me.

326
30:09.331 --> 30:10.531
Thitinant.

327
30:14.165 --> 30:14.965
Uh...

328
30:55.831 --> 30:56.846
Sorry.

329
30:57.874 --> 30:58.928
You can go now.

330
30:59.613 --> 31:03.179
I'll review the land and financial figures myself.

331
31:07.231 --> 31:08.498
Yes, Boss.

332
31:27.498 --> 31:30.065
Get a grip, Theerachat.

333
31:30.531 --> 31:31.765
Control yourself.

334
31:33.431 --> 31:36.331
If I keep this up, that girl is gonna think I'm completely obsessed with her.

335
31:38.498 --> 31:39.631
It was just a dream.

336
31:43.231 --> 31:45.565
Where's Nant?

337
31:46.298 --> 31:49.025
Miss, please calm down.

338
31:49.025 --> 31:50.298
Can I help you with something?

339
31:50.631 --> 31:51.865
I'm looking for someone named Nant.

340
31:53.465 --> 31:56.526
I'm sorry, but if this isn't work-related,

341
31:56.526 --> 31:58.601
please wait outside.

342
31:58.601 --> 31:59.731
I'll call Nant for you.

343
31:59.865 --> 32:00.454
No!

344
32:00.454 --> 32:01.879
I'll talk to her right here.

345
32:02.222 --> 32:03.974
Where the hell are you, Nant?

346
32:08.965 --> 32:09.965
I'm right here.

347
32:11.965 --> 32:14.631
Should I call security for you, Nant?

348
32:15.698 --> 32:17.231
It's okay, Hanna.

349
32:25.265 --> 32:26.465
Do you remember me?

350
32:28.931 --> 32:30.165
Of course, Gam.

351
32:31.698 --> 32:33.431
Why don't we talk outside?

352
32:33.698 --> 32:34.931
Don't pretend to be shy.

353
32:35.465 --> 32:36.898
Let everyone know

354
32:37.298 --> 32:38.465
what you've done.

355
32:41.865 --> 32:43.531
What do you want?

356
32:44.898 --> 32:45.698
Because of you,

357
32:46.031 --> 32:48.265
my boyfriend left me.

358
32:48.931 --> 32:50.265
You ruined my life.

359
32:54.065 --> 32:55.632
Gam.

360
32:56.717 --> 32:58.975
Do you remember what I told you that day?

361
33:00.802 --> 33:02.686
If you two truly loved each other,

362
33:03.765 --> 33:05.654
nothing could break you apart.

363
33:08.065 --> 33:09.665
I didn't make him leave you.

364
33:11.298 --> 33:12.365
I just said

365
33:12.898 --> 33:15.231
what your ex-boyfriend didn't have the gut to say.

366
33:15.698 --> 33:16.765
But if it weren't for you,

367
33:17.831 --> 33:19.165
he'd still be with me.

368
33:20.498 --> 33:21.531
Gam.

369
33:23.631 --> 33:24.531
Since that day,

370
33:27.065 --> 33:29.531
has he ever texted you?

371
33:31.898 --> 33:32.765
Has he ever called?

372
33:33.298 --> 33:34.098
Has he ever text to...

373
33:35.331 --> 33:37.131
asked how you're doing?

374
33:40.265 --> 33:40.765
No, never.

375
33:42.135 --> 33:43.546
Then what am I supposed to do?

376
33:43.546 --> 33:45.624
Just accept that...

377
33:46.023 --> 33:47.297
he doesn't love me?

378
33:48.565 --> 33:49.207
No.

379
33:51.719 --> 33:54.065
I'm not saying you have to accept it today.

380
33:56.265 --> 33:57.631
But even if he came back,

381
33:58.965 --> 34:00.731
his heart wouldn't be with you anymore.

382
34:02.231 --> 34:03.898
Would you really be happy like that?

383
34:21.531 --> 34:22.331
Here.

384
34:25.131 --> 34:26.098
Gam.

385
34:29.265 --> 34:30.931
You can be angry with me if you want.

386
34:32.731 --> 34:36.298
But trying to hold on to someone whose heart is no longer in it...

387
34:37.465 --> 34:38.898
won't make you happy.

388
34:41.231 --> 34:47.098
Trust me. Take care of yourself and move on.

389
35:00.098 --> 35:01.098
It's okay.

390
35:09.631 --> 35:10.431
I'm sorry.

391
35:13.098 --> 35:14.731
I'm sorry for causing a scene.

392
35:16.731 --> 35:17.565
I'm truly sorry.

393
35:18.865 --> 35:19.665
It's alright.

394
35:33.765 --> 35:34.765
Secretary Han.

395
35:35.131 --> 35:35.931
Uh...

396
35:36.265 --> 35:37.065
Yes, Boss?

397
35:38.298 --> 35:39.731
Push the meeting back by fifteen minutes.

398
35:40.698 --> 35:41.498
Certainly.

399
35:42.265 --> 35:43.698
Go get ready for the meeting.

400
35:47.131 --> 35:48.845
And whoever recorded this,

401
35:48.845 --> 35:50.209
make sure they delete every clip.

402
35:51.122 --> 35:52.600
If any of this footage gets leaked,

403
35:53.513 --> 35:54.640
I won't let it slide.

404
35:58.731 --> 35:59.531
Boss...

405
36:00.165 --> 36:01.298
I'm sorry.

406
36:03.431 --> 36:05.465
I'm sorry for causing trouble for the company.

407
36:06.431 --> 36:09.065
It's okay. You handled it well.

408
36:15.898 --> 36:17.331
Now go get ready for the meeting.

409
36:37.698 --> 36:39.365
I'm ready for the meeting, Boss.

410
36:42.365 --> 36:44.965
Are you okay after what happened?

411
36:46.631 --> 36:47.465
I'm fine.

412
36:48.898 --> 36:49.898
I handled it.

413
36:50.665 --> 36:52.698
It's something I had to take responsibility for anyway.

414
36:54.231 --> 36:56.331
I thought you were going to slap her.

415
36:58.031 --> 36:59.565
Why would I slap her?

416
37:01.431 --> 37:02.298
Just kidding.

417
37:03.231 --> 37:06.431
But it's good you didn't argue with her.

418
37:07.898 --> 37:11.208
What would arguing accomplish, Boss?

419
37:11.779 --> 37:15.574
She's heartbroken. She wouldn't listen anyway.

420
37:19.431 --> 37:23.698
You're much better at handling people than I expected.

421
37:28.731 --> 37:30.298
Thank you for the compliment.

422
37:33.098 --> 37:35.043
What compliment? Who complimented you?

423
37:36.527 --> 37:39.260
I was just saying.

424
37:41.030 --> 37:46.179
Anyway, Nant, help me review the factory production costs today.

425
37:51.331 --> 37:52.431
I'd be happy to, Boss.

426
37:58.665 --> 37:59.165
Boss.

427
38:01.677 --> 38:02.636
Tomorrow's Saturday.

428
38:04.235 --> 38:05.898
Do you have any plans?

429
38:07.265 --> 38:08.065
Why do you ask?

430
38:09.865 --> 38:14.231
Well... I was thinking of inviting you to visit my grandparents.

431
38:16.231 --> 38:17.831
I haven't seen them in ages.

432
38:19.165 --> 38:20.131
I miss them so much.

433
38:22.531 --> 38:25.265
But when I think about making the trip alone,

434
38:26.031 --> 38:28.765
I can't help thinking of someone around here.

435
38:34.898 --> 38:36.898
Please come with me, Boss.

436
38:38.165 --> 38:43.531
You suddenly want to invite me on a trip out of town?

437
38:47.965 --> 38:50.270
We could...uh...

438
38:53.010 --> 38:54.498
We could enjoy some fresh air.

439
38:55.698 --> 38:56.965
A change of scenery.

440
38:58.631 --> 38:59.431
Please?

441
38:59.965 --> 39:02.431
I want to introduce you to my grandparents.

442
39:04.065 --> 39:04.865
Okay.

443
39:08.031 --> 39:10.165
I'm free, so why not?

444
39:22.465 --> 39:27.098
Go all out today. I'm treating you to a birthday celebration for being single.

445
39:28.898 --> 39:29.931
Can we not talk about that?

446
39:30.298 --> 39:31.098
It's annoying.

447
39:31.365 --> 39:32.898
Is Chat not coming?

448
39:33.098 --> 39:34.265
Her friend just got dumped.

449
39:34.431 --> 39:35.731
Can't she even show up to wish her happy birthday?

450
39:36.665 --> 39:37.965
She said she has a meeting.

451
39:38.365 --> 39:40.365
A meeting with her secretary, apparently.

452
39:41.365 --> 39:43.865
Oh, someone's in love!

453
39:56.831 --> 40:00.296
It's so packed in here. Do you think we'll even get a table?

454
40:00.296 --> 40:01.831
I'm starving.

455
40:02.831 --> 40:03.765
Yeah, seriously.

456
40:04.965 --> 40:07.031
Excuse me, do you have any tables available?

457
40:07.331 --> 40:10.765
I'm sorry, but we're fully booked.

458
40:12.131 --> 40:15.065
Oh! Kirin Ham and Cheese.

459
40:17.865 --> 40:18.665
Ham and Cheese?

460
40:19.765 --> 40:21.531
That's such a ridiculous nickname.

461
40:22.498 --> 40:24.331
Come on, my table's still free.

462
40:24.631 --> 40:25.431
Come sit with us.

463
40:25.831 --> 40:27.165
It's okay. We don't want to impose.

464
40:27.731 --> 40:28.366
Come on, Yong!

465
40:28.366 --> 40:29.065
Wait!

466
40:29.365 --> 40:30.179
Let's eat here.

467
40:30.179 --> 40:31.098
Everywhere else is packed.

468
40:31.231 --> 40:32.083
I don't feel like going somewhere else.

469
40:32.083 --> 40:32.583
Come on!

470
40:33.298 --> 40:34.098
Let's sit!

471
40:36.098 --> 40:40.265
Hello, we were actually looking for a table. Thanks for the invite.

472
40:40.765 --> 40:43.965
Please, make yourselves comfortable.

473
40:51.298 --> 40:53.331
Who is that woman?

474
40:54.031 --> 40:54.898
She's damn gorgeous.

475
40:56.498 --> 40:59.165
That's the OB-GYN I told you about.

476
40:59.631 --> 41:00.965
The one who stole my croissant

477
41:01.165 --> 41:03.065
and gave me an internal examination.

478
41:03.631 --> 41:04.431
Hey!

479
41:04.865 --> 41:05.731
This woman?

480
41:07.065 --> 41:07.865
Holy shit.

481
41:08.331 --> 41:09.131
She's gorgeous.

482
41:15.065 --> 41:16.731
Funny how we keep running into each other.

483
41:18.165 --> 41:20.531
We must have had quite a lot of karma together in a past life.

484
41:22.231 --> 41:26.765
Anyway, any trouble down there today? Would you like another examination?

485
41:27.765 --> 41:29.620
I'm perfectly fine, Doc.

486
41:29.620 --> 41:31.165
No need to worry.

487
41:32.765 --> 41:37.331
Two minutes in and it's already a war zone. Today’s gonna be wild.

488
41:40.765 --> 41:41.765
What would you ladies like to order?

489
41:45.831 --> 41:48.531
I'll have a mixed sauce platter and an order of fries.

490
41:48.698 --> 41:49.498
Certainly.

491
41:50.631 --> 41:52.131
I was going to order fries too.

492
41:53.131 --> 41:55.265
Excuse me, could we get another order of fries?

493
41:55.698 --> 41:58.231
Sorry, we can only serve one order of fries.

494
42:01.298 --> 42:02.898
I ordered first.

495
42:05.665 --> 42:08.451
But since you're older,

496
42:08.451 --> 42:10.965
shouldn't you let the younger ones have them?

497
42:12.065 --> 42:16.176
A rude little brat like you doesn't deserve anyone's generosity.

498
42:16.176 --> 42:17.731
I ordered first.

499
42:18.020 --> 42:19.278
Wait, wait.

500
42:20.131 --> 42:26.131
Please give them to me. I'm really hungry.

501
42:27.898 --> 42:31.431
Rin, do you have to lose your mind over food every single time?

502
42:32.465 --> 42:34.698
Look at her! Is she messing with me?

503
42:37.498 --> 42:39.265
Go on, hit her.

504
42:41.631 --> 42:45.465
Uh, how about we just serve one medium plate for everyone to share?

505
42:46.331 --> 42:47.365
(Kirin) Sure. (Dr. Ai) Sure.

506
43:01.831 --> 43:03.065
Here you go.

507
43:15.465 --> 43:16.265
You spilled them!

508
43:16.698 --> 43:17.565
I'm eating these!

509
43:18.931 --> 43:20.065
Hey! I grabbed this one first!

510
43:20.165 --> 43:20.931
I grabbed this one too!

511
43:20.931 --> 43:21.765
Why are you fighting over them?

512
43:21.831 --> 43:23.165
Why did you grab the same one as me?

513
43:23.265 --> 43:24.065
Because I grabbed it first!

514
43:24.098 --> 43:24.898
No, I did!

515
43:25.565 --> 43:26.365
I grabbed it first!

516
43:27.727 --> 43:30.031
That's your problem! I'm taking this one.

517
43:30.031 --> 43:30.965
And I want this one!

518
43:37.883 --> 43:39.084
Ow!

519
43:41.810 --> 43:43.131
Hey!

520
43:43.131 --> 43:44.898
Don't back down if you don't have to.

521
43:45.386 --> 43:47.971
Bitch, stop it. I'm embarrassed for them.

522
43:48.108 --> 43:50.000
(Yong) I'll buy you a new one. (Kirin) Ugh, you're blocking me!

523
43:50.231 --> 43:51.734
This Doc has gone too far.

524
43:52.762 --> 43:53.937
She's already seen my insides once.

525
43:54.451 --> 43:55.558
I'm not backing down this time.

526
43:55.958 --> 43:58.431
What do you mean, seen your insides, Ai?

527
43:59.331 --> 44:00.498
What are you doing to your patient?

528
44:01.031 --> 44:01.831
I didn't do anything.

529
44:02.331 --> 44:04.465
Why are you bringing up what happened in the examination room?

530
44:04.731 --> 44:06.531
Do you really have to hold a grudge over something so small?

531
44:07.298 --> 44:10.298
I wouldn't hold a grudge if it were another doctor.

532
44:11.165 --> 44:13.498
But since it's you, I'm not letting it go.

533
44:15.231 --> 44:17.631
Excuse me, one bottle of wine, please!

534
44:24.565 --> 44:25.665
Let's settle this with a drinking contest.

535
44:26.331 --> 44:28.531
Let's see who wins, girl.

536
44:30.298 --> 44:32.422
Dr. Ai, don't stoop to her level.

537
44:32.422 --> 44:34.731
Her brain hasn't grown as much as the rest of her.

538
44:34.865 --> 44:36.565
Bring it on! I'm not scared.

539
44:38.031 --> 44:41.131
Go ahead. I'm ready to pay for your stomach pumping.

540
44:41.631 --> 44:43.531
Fine! I'm exhausted.

541
45:13.165 --> 45:13.965
Ow!

542
45:14.431 --> 45:15.231
Ow!

543
45:15.331 --> 45:15.965
You!

544
45:15.965 --> 45:17.865
Can't you let me win just once?

545
45:19.431 --> 45:20.231
No!

546
45:24.365 --> 45:25.020
So that's how you want to play?

547
45:25.020 --> 45:26.082
Yeah.

548
45:26.082 --> 45:26.582
What, now?

549
45:30.298 --> 45:31.665
Got a problem with that?

550
45:32.731 --> 45:34.665
You jerk!

551
45:35.665 --> 45:36.465
Just let it go.

552
45:36.631 --> 45:38.831
Hey! So you have to get physical now?

553
45:40.065 --> 45:40.865
Uh...

554
45:42.565 --> 45:43.365
Are you hurt?

555
45:43.965 --> 45:45.331
I didn't mean to.

556
45:45.765 --> 45:46.898
Of course it hurts! What a stupid question.

557
45:48.931 --> 45:49.731
Then...

558
45:51.831 --> 45:52.831
If that's all...

559
45:54.298 --> 45:55.898
Aren't you going to take any responsibility for this?

560
45:56.131 --> 45:57.707
Come and treat my wound right now.

561
45:57.707 --> 45:58.631
Dr. Ai.

562
45:59.565 --> 46:01.831
You're really going to let this kid treat your wound?

563
46:02.231 --> 46:03.365
Are you trying to get more wounded?

564
46:03.965 --> 46:05.531
You have to take responsibility, don't you?

565
46:06.631 --> 46:07.965
Treat my wound right now.

566
46:28.231 --> 46:29.898
I treated your wound. There, I took responsibility.

567
46:30.931 --> 46:31.765
Happy now?

568
46:32.731 --> 46:35.498
I asked you to treat my wound, not kiss me, idiot!

569
46:37.098 --> 46:39.731
You told me to take responsibility!

570
46:41.098 --> 46:43.765
I didn't say you could kiss me like this! You can't just go kissing people.

571
46:45.898 --> 46:47.065
Are you crazy?

572
46:47.698 --> 46:49.665
Let's go. I'm begging you. Come on!

573
46:49.931 --> 46:50.731
Why are we leaving?

574
46:50.865 --> 46:51.665
Come on!

575
46:52.131 --> 46:54.898
Wait, you look familiar.

576
46:57.131 --> 47:00.031
Oh, I remember. You're Chat's runaway groom, right?

577
47:02.231 --> 47:03.031
Yes, I am.

578
47:03.165 --> 47:04.265
Nice to meet you.

579
47:04.631 --> 47:05.865
I'm Chat's friend.

580
47:06.165 --> 47:07.665
My name's Jaokha. I'm a lawyer.

581
47:07.931 --> 47:09.365
If you ever want to sue Chat,

582
47:09.665 --> 47:10.731
you can contact me.

583
47:11.465 --> 47:13.065
I know plenty of her secrets.

584
47:13.831 --> 47:15.465
I guarantee you'll win.

585
47:17.065 --> 47:17.931
No, thank you.

586
47:19.965 --> 47:20.765
Let's go.

587
47:20.898 --> 47:22.898
Why do I keep randomly running into all these weirdos?

588
47:23.031 --> 47:24.131
Come on, hurry up.

589
47:24.331 --> 47:25.365
We're not done yet.

590
47:26.065 --> 47:27.298
Don't let me catch you again, doc!

591
47:27.631 --> 47:29.031
Next time, I won't go easy on you!

592
47:29.131 --> 47:29.931
Bring it on!

593
47:29.965 --> 47:30.765
Hey!

594
47:31.098 --> 47:31.898
You.

595
47:32.931 --> 47:33.898
Sit down, sit down.

596
47:39.231 --> 47:42.165
So, that was a new experience, huh?

597
47:44.131 --> 47:46.431
Yeah, that was one hell of a birthday.

598
48:13.092 --> 48:14.242
This way.

599
48:21.631 --> 48:23.431
Oh, Nant! You're here already?

600
48:23.765 --> 48:24.565
Hello.

601
48:25.065 --> 48:27.031
Hello, sweetheart.

602
48:28.365 --> 48:29.331
Hello, Grandpa.

603
48:29.831 --> 48:31.165
Oh, hello.

604
48:31.931 --> 48:32.898
And who's this?

605
48:33.498 --> 48:35.231
Oh, she's my boss.

606
48:36.031 --> 48:38.831
Well, I missed you both, Grandpa and Grandma, so we came to visit.

607
48:39.565 --> 48:40.365
We missed you too.

608
48:40.765 --> 48:43.631
That's right. So I brought my boss along to meet you both.

609
48:44.231 --> 48:45.531
Okay, okay

610
48:45.731 --> 48:46.365
Oh.

611
48:46.365 --> 48:48.298
So, is Grandma cooking up there?

612
48:48.898 --> 48:53.331
Since she heard you were coming, she's been stuck in the kitchen all moring.

613
48:54.650 --> 48:55.665
Oh.

614
48:56.131 --> 48:56.931
Hello, dear.

615
48:56.931 --> 48:58.698
Come on, come see who's here!

616
48:59.031 --> 49:00.931
Oh my goodness! Grandma's little girl!

617
49:03.431 --> 49:04.231
Hey.

618
49:05.031 --> 49:05.831
Hello, Grandma.

619
49:06.031 --> 49:06.831
Hello, dear.

620
49:08.098 --> 49:10.831
Did you bring your girlfriend, Nant?

621
49:13.131 --> 49:14.131
She's so pretty.

622
49:14.565 --> 49:16.031
No, no, that's not it.

623
49:16.565 --> 49:19.731
This is Ms. Chat, my boss.

624
49:21.265 --> 49:23.765
I brought her here to visit our home.

625
49:24.053 --> 49:25.270
Oh, I see.

626
49:25.898 --> 49:30.631
So, is Nant a bad girl? Does she ever give you a hard time?

627
49:31.465 --> 49:35.786
Not at all. Nant is such a lovely girl. She's very good at her job, too.

628
49:35.786 --> 49:39.965
I'm the one troubling you two by showing up at such short notice.

629
49:40.331 --> 49:41.131
Thank you for having me.

630
49:41.365 --> 49:44.209
Oh, you're no trouble at all, dear.

631
49:44.209 --> 49:49.365
Just the two of us live here, so it’s really lively having everyone over.

632
49:50.465 --> 49:54.242
You must be tired from the drive. Have something to drink first.

633
49:54.242 --> 49:59.065
I'll go finish cooking. I'll come get you when it's all ready.

634
49:59.531 --> 50:03.731
Thank you, Grandma. But I really feel bad for bothering you.

635
50:04.031 --> 50:06.311
Don't be silly. No need to feel bad.

636
50:06.311 --> 50:09.131
You're our very special guest.

637
50:09.931 --> 50:11.240
Make yourself at home.

638
50:11.240 --> 50:13.048
Even though we're out in the middle of nowhere,

639
50:13.048 --> 50:15.931
you're always welcome here.

640
50:18.165 --> 50:21.298
Nant, why don't you show Ms. Chat around?

641
50:22.531 --> 50:24.365
I'll call you when the food is ready.

642
50:24.931 --> 50:27.498
Everyone's in for a real treat this time.

643
50:29.065 --> 50:32.331
Just go look around. We'll carry your luggage.

644
50:32.465 --> 50:32.965
Yeah.

645
50:32.965 --> 50:33.465
Let's go!

646
50:33.465 --> 50:34.131
Are you sure?

647
50:34.231 --> 50:35.031
It's fine.

648
50:35.531 --> 50:36.665
Let's go, dear.

649
50:36.765 --> 50:38.165
You must be tired. Go get some rest first.

650
50:38.331 --> 50:39.498
Come on.

651
50:40.165 --> 50:41.065
Thank you, Grandpa.

652
50:41.231 --> 50:42.031
Thank you, Grandma.

653
50:42.865 --> 50:43.665
Go on, dear.

654
50:43.865 --> 50:44.665
Isn't it heavy?

655
50:45.498 --> 50:46.555
I'll be waiting for you to eat.

656
50:46.555 --> 50:47.055
Okay.

657
50:47.055 --> 50:47.731
Just wait.

658
50:48.898 --> 50:49.698
It's going to be delicious.

659
50:51.231 --> 50:52.498
The fresh air here is wonderful.

660
50:53.465 --> 50:54.465
Come on, Grandma. Let's go.

661
50:55.731 --> 50:57.131
Watch your step, will you?

662
51:01.031 --> 51:03.498
This is where I spent my childhood.

663
51:06.231 --> 51:08.698
You suddenly brought me all the way here.

664
51:09.698 --> 51:11.331
What's your plan exactly?

665
51:11.765 --> 51:12.565
Hmm?

666
51:12.698 --> 51:13.498
Nant.

667
51:13.565 --> 51:18.698
What plan, Boss? I just wanted to show you around and enjoy nature.

668
51:21.098 --> 51:27.165
Really? Cause it's written all over your face that you're up to something.

669
51:28.965 --> 51:30.231
What plan, Boss?

670
51:31.931 --> 51:36.442
I'm just teasing you. Since you brought me here for a change of scenery,

671
51:36.442 --> 51:37.765
I don't mind at all.

672
51:40.331 --> 51:46.431
Nice view here. So, what's interesting around?

673
51:47.698 --> 51:50.398
Over there, Boss. Look over there.

674
51:50.398 --> 51:53.946
I used to play and run a proper little shop here.

675
51:54.460 --> 51:55.219
Did you ever play like that, Boss?

676
51:55.961 --> 51:59.855
You know, back then, I'd use leaves...

677
51:59.855 --> 52:02.231
Big leaves, like these, as money.

678
52:02.898 --> 52:04.465
Then I'd dig up some clay

679
52:04.698 --> 52:06.331
and mold it like this.

680
52:06.531 --> 52:07.186
Uh-huh.

681
52:07.186 --> 52:08.731
And now it's turn into little desserts.

682
52:08.898 --> 52:09.465
You know!

683
52:09.465 --> 52:12.265
I took running that shop very seriously!

684
52:14.665 --> 52:17.831
Wait, a naughty girl like you actually played that before?

685
52:18.831 --> 52:20.165
I can't picture it.

686
52:20.498 --> 52:21.775
Oh, Boss.

687
52:21.775 --> 52:22.275
Hmm?

688
52:22.498 --> 52:23.731
I was a kid once, you know.

689
52:24.631 --> 52:28.298
You're acting like you were born all grown up.

690
52:29.965 --> 52:31.031
I was a kid too.

691
52:32.165 --> 52:34.642
But I never got to experience life in the countryside,

692
52:35.270 --> 52:37.326
so I never had friends to play these with.

693
52:38.753 --> 52:43.531
My childhood was spent staying within the lines and going to extra classes.

694
52:46.331 --> 52:48.631
That's why you're so successful, Boss.

695
52:50.665 --> 52:51.731
Because you didn't waste time messing around like me.

696
52:53.098 --> 52:53.898
Sigh...

697
52:54.698 --> 52:56.665
Honestly? I actually want to play around a bit too.

698
52:58.931 --> 53:03.131
But not long after Chom was born,

699
53:04.631 --> 53:05.698
my father passed away.

700
53:07.565 --> 53:11.631
So I had to grow up quickly to be there for my mom and sister.

701
53:20.331 --> 53:21.531
You're amazing, Boss.

702
53:23.365 --> 53:26.165
My Boss is the most amazing person in the world.

703
53:42.731 --> 53:44.226
But...

704
53:45.710 --> 53:49.065
You didn't bring me here for no reason, did you, Nant?

705
53:50.665 --> 53:51.465
Hmm?

706
53:52.231 --> 53:56.298
So, why exactly did you bring me here?

707
53:59.631 --> 54:00.431
I...

708
54:00.865 --> 54:02.098
There's really nothing, Boss.

709
54:03.265 --> 54:04.865
I told you already.

710
54:05.298 --> 54:06.765
I just missed my grandparents.

711
54:08.431 --> 54:09.531
There's nothing else.

712
54:10.765 --> 54:12.231
You're a terrible liar.

713
54:13.898 --> 54:15.331
Your eyes give you away.

714
54:16.898 --> 54:18.698
It's obvious you're hiding something from me.

715
54:19.098 --> 54:21.331
Hmm? Why are you smiling, you little brat?

716
54:23.031 --> 54:23.898
But that's okay.

717
54:25.131 --> 54:26.831
If you won't tell me nicely,

718
54:28.565 --> 54:29.765
I'll just have to force you.

719
54:30.365 --> 54:31.165
How?

720
54:32.431 --> 54:33.231
Like this.

721
54:36.165 --> 54:39.159
Boss, we're... we're outside!

722
54:39.159 --> 54:40.765
What if someone sees us?

723
54:42.031 --> 54:44.841
I don't care. So what?

724
54:45.469 --> 54:48.526
Is my way of forcing you scary?

725
54:53.765 --> 54:55.631
You're pretty funny, Boss.

726
54:58.498 --> 54:59.265
Boss.

727
54:59.265 --> 55:00.065
Hmm?

728
55:00.231 --> 55:01.331
What if one day...

729
55:01.698 --> 55:03.298
I really does something wrong?

730
55:05.465 --> 55:07.065
Will you be angry with me, Boss?

731
55:09.465 --> 55:10.831
If you do something wrong,

732
55:13.231 --> 55:14.765
I'll have to punish you.

733
55:17.865 --> 55:19.031
How will you punish me?

734
55:25.165 --> 55:25.965
Like this.

735
55:28.865 --> 55:30.531
This is how I punish naughty girls.

736
56:03.865 --> 56:05.631
Hey, Boss! What are you taking pictures of?

737
56:06.931 --> 56:08.631
Just keeping some evidence.

738
56:09.131 --> 56:12.898
If you ever get on my nerves or make me angry,

739
56:13.931 --> 56:16.065
I'll send these pictures to the entire company.

740
56:17.031 --> 56:19.065
Boss, why would you...

741
56:20.265 --> 56:21.465
You're so mean.

742
56:22.365 --> 56:25.265
How am I supposed to dare to do anything wrong now?

743
56:36.298 --> 56:37.431
You're so mean, Boss.

744
57:28.565 --> 57:29.282
Wait!

745
57:29.567 --> 57:31.846
Hey! Who turned off the lights?

746
57:33.765 --> 57:35.037
What are you doing, Nant?

747
57:45.765 --> 57:46.619
It's broken.

748
57:46.619 --> 57:47.217
Oh.

749
57:47.217 --> 57:47.717
Oh.

750
57:48.031 --> 57:48.965
I guess I used a little too much force.

751
57:49.531 --> 57:50.465
I've been working out.

752
57:51.498 --> 57:52.298
Uh...

753
57:53.465 --> 57:54.731
Boss, don't tell Grandma.

754
57:55.265 --> 57:56.065
Okay.

755
57:56.765 --> 57:58.331
Grandma will scold me.

756
58:00.531 --> 58:01.431
Let's keep this between us.

757
58:01.565 --> 58:02.365
Okay, okay.

758
58:26.498 --> 58:27.365
Thank you.

759
58:34.665 --> 58:36.365
Go ahead and eat first, dear.

760
58:36.831 --> 58:39.665
Grandma's going to make sure Grandpa takes his medicine.

761
58:40.231 --> 58:40.731
Okay.

762
58:40.731 --> 58:41.331
Sure.

763
58:41.531 --> 58:42.331
Enjoy your meal.

764
58:43.365 --> 58:44.165
Thank you.

765
58:48.231 --> 58:49.665
Good thing Grandma didn't see that.

766
59:14.165 --> 59:14.929
Boss.

767
59:15.728 --> 59:16.685
Eat up.

768
59:17.370 --> 59:19.965
Grandma makes the most delicious fried pork.

769
59:20.931 --> 59:21.731
Really?

770
59:23.265 --> 59:24.065
Boss.

771
59:24.131 --> 59:24.931
Hmm?

772
59:26.165 --> 59:27.131
What are you looking for?

773
59:28.131 --> 59:28.931
Uh...

774
59:29.765 --> 59:31.298
I can't find a spoon.

775
59:34.765 --> 59:35.565
Huh?

776
59:36.431 --> 59:37.465
You're eating sticky rice.

777
59:37.765 --> 59:39.165
Who eats that with a spoon?

778
59:40.065 --> 59:40.931
You eat sticky rice

779
59:41.731 --> 59:43.331
with your hands.

780
59:44.065 --> 59:44.865
Here.

781
59:45.831 --> 59:46.631
Come on.

782
59:46.731 --> 59:50.431
Let me give you a little food presentation.

783
59:52.265 --> 59:53.065
Like this.

784
59:55.331 --> 59:56.131
Like this.

785
59:58.631 --> 01:00:01.631
A traditional-style omakase.

786
01:00:03.165 --> 01:00:03.831
Here.

787
01:00:03.831 --> 01:00:05.298
Boss, let me feed you.

788
01:00:05.665 --> 01:00:06.465
Open wide.

789
01:00:12.565 --> 01:00:14.003
Come on, open up.

790
01:00:14.003 --> 01:00:14.737
Have you washed your hands?

791
01:00:14.737 --> 01:00:15.813
I have.

792
01:00:19.238 --> 01:00:20.330
It's a little salty.

793
01:00:21.244 --> 01:00:21.992
So the pork is salty?

794
01:00:22.392 --> 01:00:23.145
Heh, it's my hands.

795
01:00:28.931 --> 01:00:29.731
How is it?

796
01:00:30.565 --> 01:00:31.365
Well...

797
01:00:32.165 --> 01:00:32.965
It's good.

798
01:00:33.965 --> 01:00:34.765
What?

799
01:00:35.465 --> 01:00:36.431
Just "good"?

800
01:00:37.498 --> 01:00:38.259
You're such a liar.

801
01:00:38.259 --> 01:00:38.831
Mm-hmm.

802
01:00:39.165 --> 01:00:41.531
You were nodding just now.

803
01:00:43.265 --> 01:00:44.331
It's delicious, isn't it?

804
01:00:45.331 --> 01:00:46.131
Mm-hmm.

805
01:00:47.765 --> 01:00:48.965
It's pretty good.

806
01:01:29.831 --> 01:01:30.582
Well...

807
01:01:32.066 --> 01:01:33.355
It's actually delicious.

808
01:02:03.331 --> 01:02:04.765
Come with me, please.

809
01:02:06.131 --> 01:02:06.931
I'm scared.

810
01:02:09.631 --> 01:02:11.098
Boss? Scared?

811
01:02:12.465 --> 01:02:15.765
Funny. When we were in bed, you didn't seem scared at all.

812
01:02:17.231 --> 01:02:19.331
There's nothing to be afraid of, Boss. Don't worry.

813
01:02:20.165 --> 01:02:20.965
Nothing's there.

814
01:02:24.365 --> 01:02:25.165
Okay.

815
01:02:25.631 --> 01:02:27.065
I'll just go shower by myself.

816
01:02:27.665 --> 01:02:29.165
I don't need you. Hmph.

817
01:02:32.898 --> 01:02:36.965
Hurry up. If you take too long, the ghosts will get you.

818
01:02:41.865 --> 01:02:43.965
Walk too slowly and the ghosts will grab your feet.

819
01:02:59.498 --> 01:03:01.106
Okay.

820
01:03:02.647 --> 01:03:03.931
Your phone.

821
01:03:10.898 --> 01:03:11.798
Boss.

822
01:03:12.369 --> 01:03:13.431
What's your phone password?

823
01:03:14.165 --> 01:03:15.265
Yeah, right, like I'd ever tell you.

824
01:03:16.231 --> 01:03:17.131
So possessive.

825
01:03:24.065 --> 01:03:24.898
Basic.

826
01:03:26.531 --> 01:03:27.631
It's definitely your birthday.

827
01:03:28.831 --> 01:03:31.831
You were born on January 18th.

828
01:03:35.231 --> 01:03:36.665
One-eight-zero-one.

829
01:03:42.965 --> 01:03:44.365
Damn it, that's not it.

830
01:03:44.965 --> 01:03:45.865
Then what is it?

831
01:03:46.965 --> 01:03:48.665
Gregorian year? Buddhist year?

832
01:03:50.098 --> 01:03:51.098
Probably not.

833
01:04:00.165 --> 01:04:05.698
Don't tell me your passcode is some boomer code.

834
01:04:07.522 --> 01:04:08.266
Two.

835
01:04:08.551 --> 01:04:09.352
Three.

836
01:04:10.323 --> 01:04:11.295
Four.

837
01:04:11.606 --> 01:04:13.606
Wait!

838
01:04:17.965 --> 01:04:18.765
Boss.

839
01:04:19.131 --> 01:04:20.765
That's such an old-fashioned password.

840
01:04:24.365 --> 01:04:27.631
Let's see this camera of yours. Is the quality any good?

841
01:04:36.465 --> 01:04:37.265
Let's see.

842
01:04:39.465 --> 01:04:42.098
Why don't I look as pretty as Boss?

843
01:04:49.465 --> 01:04:50.265
Hey!

844
01:04:50.865 --> 01:04:52.831
Where did she get that photo?

845
01:04:59.631 --> 01:05:00.131
Hey!

846
01:05:00.131 --> 01:05:00.931
Hey!

847
01:05:01.165 --> 01:05:01.965
What?

848
01:05:02.165 --> 01:05:03.665
Were you snooping through my phone?

849
01:05:04.431 --> 01:05:05.231
Boss.

850
01:05:05.831 --> 01:05:09.165
Why do you have so many pictures of me saved on your phone?

851
01:05:09.565 --> 01:05:10.731
Uh... Well...

852
01:05:12.898 --> 01:05:18.036
I... I only saved them for blackmail.

853
01:05:19.806 --> 01:05:24.902
So I could send them to everyone at the company if you misbehave.

854
01:05:29.331 --> 01:05:30.131
Boss.

855
01:05:30.898 --> 01:05:31.698
Hmm?

856
01:05:34.431 --> 01:05:36.265
Can you swear

857
01:05:38.731 --> 01:05:39.698
that you...

858
01:05:42.765 --> 01:05:44.331
have never used my pictures for anything else?

859
01:05:47.973 --> 01:05:48.888
Hmm?

860
01:06:04.698 --> 01:06:06.698
Let me be your first, okay?

861
01:06:41.498 --> 01:06:42.831
Your first time...

862
01:06:44.298 --> 01:06:45.565
belongs to me now.

863
01:07:12.665 --> 01:07:16.750
Oh, Chat. Why is your face so red, dear?

864
01:07:17.207 --> 01:07:18.422
Do you have a fever?

865
01:07:20.765 --> 01:07:21.565
No, Grandma.

866
01:07:23.631 --> 01:07:24.765
It's just hot.

867
01:07:25.098 --> 01:07:25.831
Really?

868
01:07:25.831 --> 01:07:26.698
Hot. Very hot.

869
01:07:27.031 --> 01:07:27.831
I'm sweating.

870
01:07:27.931 --> 01:07:30.298
But I think it's quite cold in here.

871
01:07:30.898 --> 01:07:31.698
Mm-hmm.

872
01:07:31.898 --> 01:07:32.698
Right.

873
01:07:33.465 --> 01:07:34.765
I thinks it's freezing, too.

874
01:07:35.698 --> 01:07:37.365
I've got goosebumps all over.

875
01:07:38.731 --> 01:07:39.698
Uh... Uh...

876
01:07:40.131 --> 01:07:41.831
Excuse me, Grandma.

877
01:07:52.331 --> 01:07:55.565
So, is it hot or cold, Nant?

878
01:07:56.465 --> 01:07:57.431
I have no idea, Grandma.

879
01:08:00.965 --> 01:08:04.898
Grandma, can I sleep with you tonight?

880
01:08:07.898 --> 01:08:08.698
No way.

881
01:08:09.065 --> 01:08:10.231
You're better off sleeping over there.

882
01:08:10.498 --> 01:08:14.298
You're all grown up now. Why squeeze in with me? I'll feel cramped.

883
01:08:14.731 --> 01:08:15.531
Come on.

884
01:08:16.698 --> 01:08:17.498
I promise

885
01:08:18.031 --> 01:08:20.931
I'll make myself as small as I was when I was little.

886
01:08:21.631 --> 01:08:24.131
Please let me sleep with you.

887
01:08:29.231 --> 01:08:33.065
Are you really going to leave your girlfriend sleeping all alone?

888
01:08:33.865 --> 01:08:37.298
Oh, it's fine, Grandma. She can sleep by herself.

889
01:08:38.231 --> 01:08:39.031
Hahaha.

890
01:08:39.765 --> 01:08:40.965
Hey! No, that's not it!

891
01:08:42.231 --> 01:08:43.498
She's not my girlfriend.

892
01:08:43.898 --> 01:08:45.565
She is my boss.

893
01:08:46.265 --> 01:08:49.098
Oh, so she's not your girlfriend.

894
01:08:50.511 --> 01:08:52.511
But she's your husband.

895
01:08:53.321 --> 01:08:54.965
Whoa!

896
01:08:54.965 --> 01:08:56.298
That's quite something, Grandma.

897
01:08:58.065 --> 01:09:00.990
Alright, alright. If she's not, then she's not.

898
01:09:01.732 --> 01:09:05.031
By the way, did you see your mother while you were there?

899
01:09:09.231 --> 01:09:10.265
No, I didn't.

900
01:09:16.365 --> 01:09:19.031
Is Grandpa asleep already?

901
01:09:20.931 --> 01:09:22.098
Your grandpa?

902
01:09:23.365 --> 01:09:25.231
He's glued to his phone all the time.

903
01:09:25.865 --> 01:09:28.531
Whoa, that is totally unacceptable. Unacceptable.

904
01:09:29.698 --> 01:09:34.265
I'll go scold that naughty man after I finish showering.

905
01:09:35.365 --> 01:09:36.631
Why won't he go to bed?

906
01:09:37.298 --> 01:09:40.031
I'll go take a shower first, Grandma.

907
01:09:40.298 --> 01:09:41.098
Alright, dear.

908
01:09:41.831 --> 01:09:43.465
I need to go scold that naughty man.

909
01:10:02.865 --> 01:10:03.919
So...

910
01:10:05.575 --> 01:10:08.921
What kind of person is Nant's mother, anyway?

911
01:12:22.765 --> 01:12:24.331
What the hell is going on here?

912
01:12:24.531 --> 01:12:25.731
You have to take responsibility!

913
01:12:26.165 --> 01:12:28.031
The total comes to 25,000.

914
01:12:28.465 --> 01:12:29.265
From now on,

915
01:12:29.631 --> 01:12:31.898
I don't want you doing anything dangerous like that again.

916
01:12:32.331 --> 01:12:34.331
Then where am I supposed to get the money?

917
01:12:36.365 --> 01:12:37.165
From me.

918
01:12:39.131 --> 01:12:42.231
Let me be...the only one who hires you.
